OL,3,CPlane on way to Dubai to extradite
OL,4,Calleged Irish crime boss Daniel Kinahan
OL,6,FIreland's government jet is on its way
OL,7,Fto Dubai for the extradition of
OL,8,Falleged gang leader Daniel Kinahan.
OL,10,FIt comes after several months of
OL,11,Fpreparations following the arrest of
OL,12,Fthe Dublin-born boxing promoter in the
OL,13,FUnited Arab Emirates (UAE).
OL,15,FKinahan, aged in his late 40s, was
OL,16,Fdetained under an arrest warrant
OL,17,Fissued by the Irish courts in relation
OL,18,Fto alleged serious organised crime
OL,19,Foffences.
