OL,3,CPlane on way to Dubai to extradite
OL,4,Calleged Irish crime boss Daniel Kinahan
OL,6,FThe Irish government jet took off from
OL,7,FCasement aerodrome in Baldonnel on the
OL,8,Foutskirts of Dublin on Saturday
OL,9,Fmorning.
OL,11,FIt is expected to touch down in
OL,12,FIreland on Sunday evening.
OL,14,FKinahan, the alleged leader of the
OL,15,FKinahan organised crime group, was
OL,16,Farrested in accordance with a
OL,17,Fbilateral agreement on extradition
OL,18,Fbetween Ireland and the UAE.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/4
