PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786353512
OL,3,CPlane on way to Dubai to extradite
OL,4,Calleged Irish crime boss Daniel Kinahan
OL,6,FThe High Court in Dublin previously
OL,7,Fnamed Kinahan, who has recently been
OL,8,Fliving in the UAE, as a senior figure
OL,9,Fin an organised crime gang involved in
OL,10,Finternational drug trafficking and
OL,11,Ffirearms offences.
OL,13,FThe Kinahan cartel was involved in a
OL,14,Ffeud with the rival Hutch crime gang
OL,15,Fin Ireland, which began in 2015 and
OL,16,Fresulted in 18 deaths.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/4
