OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786353512
OL,3,CPlane on way to Dubai to extradite
OL,4,Calleged Irish crime boss Daniel Kinahan
OL,6,FIn 2016, an attempt was made on
OL,7,FKinahan's life at a boxing weigh-in at
OL,8,Fthe Regency Hotel in Dublin. US
OL,9,Fauthorities issued a reward of up to
OL,10,F$5 million (#3.7 million) for
OL,11,FKinahan's arrest.
OL,13,FIn 2022, US authorities issued a
OL,14,Freward of up to five million dollars
OL,15,F(4.3 million euro/#3.7 million) for
OL,16,FKinahan's arrest.
